 window is needed.
 
+Override ``launch_env()`` to supply the browser child's environment, for example a
+dedicated ``DISPLAY`` or a mapping excluding application credentials. The display
+preflight checks this mapping on Linux. The default is ``None`` (normal environment
+inheritance); this never changes the parent process's environment or browser selection.
+
